        {
          "text": "Naye naboola ari Kho bulaano enjaachile okhusungana nende Omwami; haundi bakhanyoolekha amakhumi kabili. Naye naboola mbu Shindalalimulula tawe khulwabo amakhumi kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
