              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasunga mbu Omwami arasinyishila ta, ndalasunga khandi lulala lwonyene; haundi ekhumi bakhanyoolekhamwo. Naye ari Shindalalimulula khulwabo ekhumi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.32",
